---
source: crates/qrec-core/src/keymap.rs
expression: cheat_sheet(&map)
---
Record
  r                     Start / stop recording                     record.toggle
  o                     Record over the selection                  record.over
  d                     Discard the last take (to the bin)         take.discard-last
  Esc                   Cancel recording, deselect, close overlay  cancel

Playback
  Space                 Play / pause                               play.toggle
  j                     Shuttle reverse (again: 2×, 4×)            shuttle.reverse
  k                     Shuttle stop                               shuttle.stop
  l                     Shuttle forward (again: 2×, 4×)            shuttle.forward
  ←                     Previous frame                             seek.prev-frame
  →                     Next frame                                 seek.next-frame
  Shift+←               Back 1 s                                   seek.back
  Shift+→               Forward 1 s                                seek.forward
  ↑                     Previous edit point                        seek.prev-edit
  ↓                     Next edit point                            seek.next-edit
  Home                  Timeline start                             seek.start
  End                   Timeline end                               seek.end

Edit
  ,                     Select previous clip                       select.prev
  .                     Select next clip                           select.next
  <                     Move selection left one slot               clip.move-left
  >                     Move selection right one slot              clip.move-right
  s                     Split clip at the playhead                 clip.split
  [                     Trim start to the playhead                 clip.trim-start
  ]                     Trim end to the playhead                   clip.trim-end
  Alt+[                 Trim 1 frame off the start                 clip.nudge-start
  Alt+]                 Trim 1 frame off the end                   clip.nudge-end
  Alt+{                 Trim 10 frames off the start               clip.nudge-start-10
  Alt+}                 Trim 10 frames off the end                 clip.nudge-end-10
  Del  x  Backspace     Remove selected clips (to the bin)         clip.remove
  x                     Autocut the selection, or every clip       autocut.run
  Shift+C               Autocut settings and preview               autocut.preview
  Ctrl+Z                Undo                                       history.undo
  Ctrl+Shift+Z  Ctrl+Y  Redo                                       history.redo
  Ctrl+A                Select all clips                           select.all

Output
  f                     Save the frame at the playhead (PNG)       frame.save
  Ctrl+E                Export…                                    export

View
  =                     Zoom timeline in                           zoom.in
  -                     Zoom timeline out                          zoom.out
  \                     Zoom to fit                                zoom.fit
  z                     Zoom to the selection                      zoom.selection
  n                     Toggle snapping                            snapping.toggle
  Tab                   Switch canvas Live / Program               canvas.mode
  b                     Toggle the bin                             bin.toggle
  ?                     Cheat sheet                                keys.help
  Ctrl+K  :             Command palette                            palette.open
  Ctrl+,                Settings                                   settings.open
  F6                    Focus the next region                      region.next
  Shift+F6              Focus the previous region                  region.prev
  Ctrl+Q                Quit                                       app.quit

Canvas
  ←                     Nudge layer left 1 px                      layer.nudge-left
  →                     Nudge layer right 1 px                     layer.nudge-right
  ↑                     Nudge layer up 1 px                        layer.nudge-up
  ↓                     Nudge layer down 1 px                      layer.nudge-down
  Shift+←               Nudge layer left 10 px                     layer.nudge-left-10
  Shift+→               Nudge layer right 10 px                    layer.nudge-right-10
  Shift+↑               Nudge layer up 10 px                       layer.nudge-up-10
  Shift+↓               Nudge layer down 10 px                     layer.nudge-down-10

Problems
  x is bound to clip.remove and autocut.run in global; neither runs until keys.toml changes one
  keys.toml: unknown binding `nope` (`qrec keys` lists the ids)
